<p>
I've worked on multiple web development projects, applying technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB to build interactive interfaces and full-stack applications. I enjoy exploring how different parts of a web application work together, from designing responsive frontends to developing server-side functionality and integrating databases.
